# If your clone sits in a synced folder (OneDrive, Dropbox, etc.), big working
# data — downloaded SDKs, source games, reconstructed projects, web build output —
# must NOT live here. It goes in %LOCALAPPDATA%\RenpyRehost\ instead (the CLI
# defaults there; override with --sdk-cache / --work / --out).

# If any of these ever appear here anyway, don't track them:
/sdk/
/games/
/builds/
*-dists/

# .NET build output
bin/
obj/
dist/

# Personal/local notes that reference private projects — not for the public repo
docs/GHOSTVIEW-INTEGRATION.md

# OS
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
